<reference id="remedy" xml:lang="en-us" >
 <title><xmlelement>remedy</xmlelement></title>
 <shortdesc>The <xmlelement>remedy</xmlelement> element contains steps that are a potential solution
  for the problem described in the <xmlelement>condition</xmlelement> element, the topic
   <xmlelement>title</xmlelement> element, or the <xmlelement>shortdesc</xmlelement> element.
  Typically, a <xmlelement>remedy</xmlelement> is preceded by a
  <xmlelement>cause</xmlelement>.</shortdesc>
